{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Setting:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your humble hot dog stand is nestled in between your most heated rivals inside of a failing hockey rink. Your appliances are broken, your rating is at an all-time low, and you only have a few days to turn things around or else you'll be out of business.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Minimalistic, fast-paced cooking game where the focus is more on order quickness, accuracy and sabotaging the competition rather than juggling food inventory and storage.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Two Game Modes:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Career Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The classic GTG experience.\u00a0 Pay back your loan within 7 days to win the game. Survive sabotages from your competitors and hire your friends to attack them back. Playtime ~30 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sandbox Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose how you want to play! Just looking to cook some dogs and chill? Turn off sabotages and win/lose conditions to play forever. Looking for a more challenging experience? Dial up the sabotages and set a max order failure rate and see how long you can last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SERVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520630/extras/Serve.gif?t=1745845352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve a variety of delicious, quality food such as hot dogs, french fries and drinks, to eager customers at the rink! The customers are not the most patient bunch, so accuracy and speed is key!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520630/extras/Upgrade_your_stand!.gif?t=1745845352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your stand to include new appliances, unlocking better recipes to keep your customers coming back!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SABOTAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520630/extras/Sabotage_the_competition!.gif?t=1745845352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire your friends to sabotage your competitors' stands to keep them from sabotaging yours! Cut their power, destroy their appliances and attempt to rob them to make sure your stand is the top stand at the rink!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Let there be light!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2520630/8394754b71bb853db69691e91819e99c74933a70.jpg"},{"name":"A Perfect Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2520630/6b211024100245d771e8d83587dd7d3ec8a66aae.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta get 'em all","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2520630/00036dceaedff6f952a27728305e846ea10acf54.jpg"},{"name":"SABOTAGE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2520630/5c65a2487e80890dd7301918b4a70883abd23f3b.jpg"},{"name":"Paid in Full","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2520630/60deb6f4bb37fb85016c81b715c2485b23726381.jpg"},{"name":"100 Glizzys","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2520630/164360d5dacc6486b5e2ceb2b879d5d2075bfdd7.jpg"},{"name":"500 Glizzys!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2520630/f9c4e8d780238c7d35903499c47ab726ac2a095e.jpg"},{"name":"Ideal Client","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2520630/e684d66159b37b5dd0c1e1e412bfd1219d8ac4cc.jpg"},{"name":"Master Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2520630/97ca2976956d4674bf70f